{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@1935","endTime":318152.314,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 09\nGlocal Expert.\n\nClarigo’s Glocal Expert portfolio artwork presents a colorful education website with learning content and service information.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nEducation interface\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nExplore the original Glocal presentation.\n\nThe supplied Glocal Expert artwork shows an education-oriented interface with science imagery, service panels, and introductory content. This page follows that visible material. The separate legacy detail text describes legal advice, so those conflicting claims have been excluded from this presentation.\n\nThe original listing pairs this artwork with Glocal Expert. Its legacy description refers to a different subject; this page describes the supplied artwork only.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Glocal Expert's original project material.\n\n01\nEducational imagery\n\nScience and learning illustrations lead the supplied web composition.\n\n02\nService panels\n\nColored content blocks separate the offering into sections.\n\n03\nIntroductory navigation\n\nTop-level links organize the public website.\n\n04\nDevice artwork\n\nThe original source pairs desktop and tablet views.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nEducation interface\n\nA bright yellow presentation frame surrounds a multicolored website. Distinct content bands and large educational illustrations divide the interface into recognizable sections, with compact navigation across the top.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Glocal Expert.\n\nExplore the original design compositions. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nGlocal Expert's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nGlocal Expert / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nMercury Mailroom\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nWORKPLACE OPERATIONS\nMercury Mailroom\nMATRIMONY & DISCOVERY\nUmeed\nEDUCATION & SERVICES\nAlum-connect\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
